  "title": "Week 23: Dify",
  "date": "2025-05-30T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Week 23: Dify\n\nLLMs\n\nLast year, I was using a AI tool called Flowise. This time, I will talk about Dify, Dify can do almost everything Flowise can do. But the UI is more user-friendly.\n\nAfter last week, I started to widely use commercial LLMs. I think it is important for me to understand how to use them. So, tools like flowise, Dify and n8n even langchain are important for me. Next week I will focus on using them.\n\nUnity Unit Testing\n\nUnity provides a good unit testing tool, but there are some flaws when using them. I've mentioned in Unity Test Framework.\n\nUnreal Engine\n\nExcept for AI study and Unity unit testing. I also started to study programming in Unreal Engine.\n\nHere are two tutorials I think that is helpful:\n\nBlueprint Essential Concepts\n\nProgramming Kickstart",
